武功 野球拳，x 10，y 0","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:35.6961722\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1349,"kind":"dialogue","message":"霍青桐：Milady de Winter. An excellent entrance, traveler. Let\u0027s put it to use.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:35.7260055\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1350,"kind":"operation","message":"离开战斗","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:35.7260652\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1351,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：What did you read that was worth five swords?","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:35.7523324\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1352,"kind":"dialogue","message":"霍青桐：Payments. Names. Things powerful men prefer to forget. Rochefort\u0027s holding my courier at the Cardinal\u0027s Tower.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:35.7803340\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1353,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：I\u0027ll help get the courier out. That doesn\u0027t make me part of your schemes.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:35.8086893\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1354,"kind":"dialogue","message":"霍青桐：Of course. We have a common interest. For now, that\u0027s more useful than trust.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:35.8349857\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1355,"kind":"dialogue","message":"霍青桐：I\u0027ll travel with you. Take this Threefold Swordplay Manual. Even a useful ally needs practice.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:35.8615502\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1356,"kind":"party","message":"霍青桐加入队伍（参战）。","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:35.8907127\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1357,"kind":"item","message":"获得「三分剑术」×1","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:35.8913629\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1358,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：A letter from Grimm?","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:35.8933240\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1359,"kind":"dialogue","message":"南贤：Come see me.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:35.9205042\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1360,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：Concise. He must be saving ink for the stories.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:35.9475982\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1361,"kind":"dialogue","message":"汉家松鼠：Field note: visiting Grimm advances the world story. Some unfinished encounters may close permanently. Finish what matters to you and save before returning.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:35.9743406\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1362,"kind":"operation","message":"分配属性：属性 bili，points 2","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.0602122\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1363,"kind":"story","message":"【霍青桐】装备【金头箍】","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.1831189\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1364,"kind":"operation","message":"穿戴装备：物品编号 9","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.1861658\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1365,"kind":"operation","message":"与地点交互：地点 杭州","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.2390190\u002B00:00","mapId":"杭州"},{"id":1366,"kind":"operation","message":"与地点交互：地点 六和塔","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.2573050\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1367,"kind":"dialogue","message":"张召重：D\u0027Artagnan. Still rushing into other people\u0027s affairs?","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.2814331\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1368,"kind":"operation","message":"与地点交互：地点 朝廷走狗","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.2815166\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1369,"kind":"dialogue","message":"陈家洛：You locked up a courier for carrying a letter. I\u0027d call that an invitation.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.3017252\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1370,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：Milady sent us. I\u0027m beginning to suspect she left out a few details.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.3203910\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1371,"kind":"dialogue","message":"陈家洛：She usually does. Get me past these guards; I\u0027ll bring the courier out.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.3388650\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1372,"kind":"dialogue","message":"张召重：The prisoner stays. Guards, make sure our guests understand.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.3566206\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1373,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：Rescue first. Explanations afterward.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.3758794\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1374,"kind":"battle","message":"进入战斗：六和塔_战斗。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.3965703\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1375,"kind":"battle","message":"张召重休息调息。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.4229036\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1376,"kind":"battle","message":"朝廷鹰犬受到 700 点伤害（暴击）。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.4486874\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1377,"kind":"battle","message":"Wren施展「野球拳」。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.4486907\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1378,"kind":"operation","message":"施展招式：武功 野球拳，x 5，y 1","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.4523182\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1379,"kind":"operation","message":"战场走位：x 3，y 2","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.4725352\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1380,"kind":"battle","message":"朝廷鹰犬受到 305 点伤害。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.4998128\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1381,"kind":"battle","message":"李文秀施展「流星锤」。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.4998152\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1382,"kind":"battle","message":"朝廷鹰犬受到 171 点伤害。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.5288548\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1383,"kind":"battle","message":"钟灵施展「罗汉拳」。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.5288571\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1384,"kind":"battle","message":"朝廷鹰犬休息调息。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.5295090\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1385,"kind":"battle","message":"朝廷鹰犬休息调息。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:36.5302221\u002B00:00","mapId":"六和塔"},{"id":1386,"kind":"battle","message":"Wren受到 